# Node modules (use npm ci in Docker)
sdn-js/node_modules
node_modules
# ...except the pure-WASI HD wallet artifact. The node cannot derive a
# mnemonic-backed identity without it (internal/node/node.go:1472-1479 search
# list), and without a mnemonic identity there is no root admin sign-in either
# ("node identity bundle not loaded"). It ships to /usr/local/lib in the image.
!sdn-js/node_modules/hd-wallet-wasm/dist/hd-wallet-wasi.wasm

